      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Step 1: We need to find an integer \\( x \\) such that:\n\\[ x \\equiv 5 \\pmod{7} \\]\n\\[ x \\equiv 10 \\pmod{11} \\]\n\\[ x \\equiv 10 \\pmod{13} \\]",
      "z": -0.7084831982657112
    },
    {
